# Component folders

App components live under `src/components/`. Put new files in the matching folder. Do not dump site components next to Shadcn in `ui/`. Folders may be empty until a build session creates files. Example filenames below are not a required catalog.

```
src/components/
  ui/          # Shadcn only (CLI). e.g. button.tsx, card.tsx
  layout/      # Chrome: header, footer, site shell
  sections/    # Page blocks, grouped by section folder
    x/         # e.g. sections/hero/hero_1.tsx
  shared/      # Reused site pieces: logo, container
```

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — custom site UI in ui/, or a page section at the components root
src/components/ui/header.tsx
src/components/hero.tsx

// ✅ GOOD
src/components/layout/header.tsx
src/components/layout/footer.tsx
src/components/sections/hero/hero_1.tsx
src/components/shared/logo.tsx
src/components/shared/container.tsx
src/components/ui/button.tsx // Shadcn CLI only
```

Add Shadcn primitives with the Shadcn CLI into `src/components/ui/` only. Compose them from `layout/`, `sections/`, and `shared/`.
